   "t": "p",
   "html": "The UK in places was battered by hurricane Ophelia, what would this hold in store for the east coast of the UK, high winds battering the coastline, well unfortunately on the east coast the wind was blowing offshore so not really much sand blown or washed off of the beach. Decided to take the <a href=\"@minelab-manticore/\" data-kind=\"internal\">Minelab Etrac</a> for a few hours detecting on the dry sand and the wet sand, managed to recover some pretty decent older coins but not really what i was expecting"
